\q2 \rb the righteous deeds|צִדְקֹ֥ת\rb* \rb of His villagers|פִּרְזֹנ֖וֹ\rb*\f + \fr 5:11 \ft Or \fqa warriors\f* \rb in Israel.|בְּיִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb Then|אָ֛ז\rb* \rb the people|עַם־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\q2 \rb went down|יָרְד֥וּ\rb* \rb to the gates:|לַשְּׁעָרִ֖ים\rb*
\q1 \v 12 \rb ‘Awake,|עוּרִ֤י\rb* \rb awake,|עוּרִי֙\rb* \rb O Deborah!|דְּבוֹרָ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb Awake,|ע֥וּרִי\rb* \rb awake,|ע֖וּרִי\rb* \rb sing|דַּבְּרִי־\rb* \rb a song!|שִׁ֑יר\rb*
\q1 \rb Arise,|ק֥וּם\rb* \rb O Barak,|בָּרָ֛ק\rb*
\q2 \rb and take hold of|שֶׁבְיְךָ֖\rb* \rb your captives,|וּֽשֲׁבֵ֥ה\rb* \rb O son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Abinoam!’|אֲבִינֹֽעַם׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 13 \rb Then|אָ֚ז\rb* \rb the survivors|שָׂרִ֔יד\rb* \rb came down|יְרַ֣ד\rb* \rb to the nobles;|לְאַדִּירִ֖ים\rb*
\q2 \rb the people|עָ֑ם\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֕ה\rb* \rb came down|יְרַד־\rb* \rb to me|לִ֖י\rb* \rb against the mighty.|בַּגִּבּוֹרִֽים׃\rb*
\q1 \v 14 \rb Some came from|מִנִּ֣י\rb* \rb Ephraim,|אֶפְרַ֗יִם\rb* \rb with their roots|שָׁרְשָׁם֙\rb* \rb in Amalek;|בַּעֲמָלֵ֔ק\rb*
\q2 \rb Benjamin|בִנְיָמִ֖ין\rb* \rb came with your people|בַּֽעֲמָמֶ֑יךָ\rb* \rb after you.|אַחֲרֶ֥יךָ\rb*
\q1 \rb The commanders|מְחֹ֣קְקִ֔ים\rb* \rb came down|יָֽרְדוּ֙\rb* \rb from|מִנִּ֣י\rb* \rb Machir,|מָכִ֗יר\rb*
\q2 \rb the bearers|מֹשְׁכִ֖ים\rb* \rb of the marshal’s|סֹפֵֽר׃\rb* \rb staff|בְּשֵׁ֥בֶט\rb* \rb from Zebulun.|וּמִ֨זְּבוּלֻ֔ן\rb*
\b 
