\q2 \rb and Issachar|וְיִשָּׂשכָר֙\rb*\rb |כֵּ֣ן\rb* \rb was with Barak,|בָּרָ֔ק\rb*
\q2 \rb rushing|שֻׁלַּ֣ח\rb* \rb into the valley|בָּעֵ֖מֶק\rb* \rb at his heels.|בְּרַגְלָ֑יו\rb*
\q1 \rb In the clans|בִּפְלַגּ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of Reuben|רְאוּבֵ֔ן\rb*
