\q1 \v 16 \rb Why|לָ֣מָּה\rb* \rb did you sit|יָשַׁ֗בְתָּ\rb* \rb among|בֵּ֚ין\rb* \rb the sheepfolds|הַֽמִּשְׁפְּתַ֔יִם\rb*
\q2 \rb to hear|לִשְׁמֹ֖עַ\rb* \rb the whistling|שְׁרִק֣וֹת\rb* \rb for the flocks?|עֲדָרִ֑ים\rb*
\q1 \rb In the clans|לִפְלַגּ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of Reuben|רְאוּבֵ֔ן\rb*
\q2 \rb there was great|גְּדוֹלִ֖ים\rb* \rb indecision.|חִקְרֵי־\rb*\rb |לֵֽב׃\rb*
\b 
