\q2 \rb Dan,|וְדָ֕ן\rb* \rb why|לָ֥מָּה\rb* \rb did you linger|יָג֖וּר\rb* \rb by the ships?|אֳנִיּ֑וֹת\rb*
\q1 \rb Asher|אָשֵׁ֗ר\rb* \rb stayed|יָשַׁב֙\rb* \rb at the coast|לְח֣וֹף\rb*\rb |יַמִּ֔ים\rb*
