\p \v 1 \rb Again the Israelites|בְנֵי־\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֛ל\rb* \rb did|וַיַּעֲשׂ֧וּ\rb* \rb evil|הָרַ֖ע\rb* \rb in the sight|בְּעֵינֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the LORD;|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb so He|יְהוָ֛ה\rb* \rb delivered them|וַיִּתְּנֵ֧ם\rb* \rb into the hand|בְּיַד־\rb* \rb of Midian|מִדְיָ֖ן\rb* \rb for seven|שֶׁ֥בַע\rb* \rb years,|שָׁנִֽים׃\rb* \v 2 \rb and the hand|יַד־\rb* \rb of Midian|מִדְיָ֖ן\rb* \rb prevailed|וַתָּ֥עָז\rb* \rb against|עַל־\rb* \rb Israel.|יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb Because of|מִפְּנֵ֨י\rb* \rb the Midianites,|מִדְיָ֜ן\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֗ל\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb prepared|עָשֽׂוּ\rb* \rb shelters|הַמִּנְהָרוֹת֙\rb* \rb for themselves|לָהֶ֣ם׀\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb in the mountains,|בֶּֽהָרִ֔ים\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb caves,|הַמְּעָר֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb and strongholds.|הַמְּצָדֽוֹת׃\rb*
\p \v 3 \rb |וְהָיָ֖ה\rb* \rb Whenever|אִם־\rb* \rb the Israelites|יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb planted their crops,|זָרַ֣ע\rb* \rb the Midianites,|מִדְיָ֧ן\rb* \rb Amalekites,|וַֽעֲמָלֵ֛ק\rb* \rb and other people|וּבְנֵי־\rb* \rb of the east|קֶ֖דֶם\rb* \rb would come up|וְעָלָ֨ה\rb* \rb and invade|וְעָל֥וּ\rb* \rb them,|עָלָֽיו׃\rb* \v 4 \rb encamping|וַיַּחֲנ֣וּ\rb* \rb against them|עֲלֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb as far as|עַד־\rb*\rb |בּוֹאֲךָ֖\rb* \rb Gaza|עַזָּ֑ה\rb* \rb and destroying|וַיַּשְׁחִ֙יתוּ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the produce|יְב֣וּל\rb* \rb of the land.|הָאָ֔רֶץ\rb* \rb They left|יַשְׁאִ֤ירוּ\rb* \rb Israel|בְּיִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb with no|וְלֹֽא־\rb* \rb sustenance,|מִֽחְיָה֙\rb* \rb neither sheep|וְשֶׂ֥ה\rb* \rb nor oxen|וָשׁ֖וֹר\rb* \rb nor donkeys.|וַחֲמֽוֹר׃\rb* \v 5 \rb For|כִּ֡י\rb* \rb the Midianites|הֵם֩\rb* \rb came|יָבֹאוּ\rb* \rb with their livestock|וּמִקְנֵיהֶ֨ם\rb*\rb |יַעֲל֜וּ\rb* \rb and their tents|וְאָהֳלֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb like a great|לָרֹ֔ב\rb* \rb swarm|כְדֵֽי־\rb* \rb of locusts.|אַרְבֶּה֙\rb* \rb They|וְלָהֶ֥ם\rb* \rb and their camels|וְלִגְמַלֵּיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb were innumerable,|אֵ֣ין\rb*\rb |מִסְפָּ֑ר\rb* \rb and they entered|וַיָּבֹ֥אוּ\rb* \rb the land|בָאָ֖רֶץ\rb* \rb to ravage it.|לְשַׁחֲתָֽהּ׃\rb*
