\p \v 2 \rb “I was sure|וַיֹּ֣אמֶר\rb*\rb |אָמֹ֤ר\rb* \rb that|כִּי־\rb* \rb you thoroughly hated her,”|שָׂנֹ֣א\rb*\rb |שְׂנֵאתָ֔הּ\rb* \rb said|אָמַ֙רְתִּי֙\rb* \rb her father,|אָבִ֗יהָ\rb* \rb “so I gave her|וָאֶתְּנֶ֖נָּה\rb* \rb to one of the men who accompanied you.|לְמֵרֵעֶ֑ךָ\rb* \rb Is not|הֲלֹ֨א\rb* \rb her younger|הַקְּטַנָּה֙\rb* \rb sister|אֲחֹתָ֤הּ\rb* \rb more beautiful|טוֹבָ֣ה\rb* \rb than she?|מִמֶּ֔נָּה\rb* \rb Please|נָ֥א\rb* \rb take her|תְּהִי־\rb* \rb instead.”|תַּחְתֶּֽיהָ׃\rb*
