\p \v 3 \rb But Samson|שִׁמְשׁוֹן֮\rb* \rb lay there|וַיִּשְׁכַּ֣ב\rb* \rb only until|עַד־\rb* \rb midnight,|חֲצִ֣י\rb*\rb |הַלַּיְלָה֒\rb* \rb when he got up,|וַיָּ֣קָם׀\rb*\rb |בַּחֲצִ֣י\rb*\rb |הַלַּ֗יְלָה\rb* \rb took hold|וַיֶּאֱחֹ֞ז\rb* \rb of the doors|בְּדַלְת֤וֹת\rb* \rb of the city|הָעִיר֙\rb* \rb gate|שַֽׁעַר־\rb* \rb and both|וּבִשְׁתֵּ֣י\rb* \rb gateposts,|הַמְּזוּז֔וֹת\rb* \rb and pulled them out,|וַיִּסָּעֵם֙\rb* \rb bar|הַבְּרִ֔יחַ\rb* \rb and all.|עִֽם־\rb* \rb Then he put them|וַיָּ֖שֶׂם\rb* \rb on|עַל־\rb* \rb his shoulders|כְּתֵפָ֑יו\rb* \rb and took them|וַֽיַּעֲלֵם֙\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the top|רֹ֣אשׁ\rb* \rb of the mountain|הָהָ֔ר\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb overlooking|עַל־\rb*\rb |פְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb Hebron.|חֶבְרֽוֹן׃פ\rb*
\s1 Samson and Delilah
\p \v 4 \rb |וַֽיְהִי֙\rb* \rb Some time later,|אַחֲרֵי־\rb*\rb |כֵ֔ן\rb* \rb Samson fell in love with|וַיֶּאֱהַ֥ב\rb* \rb a woman|אִשָּׁ֖ה\rb* \rb in the Valley|בְּנַ֣חַל\rb* \rb of Sorek,|שֹׂרֵ֑ק\rb* \rb whose name|וּשְׁמָ֖הּ\rb* \rb was Delilah.|דְּלִילָֽה׃\rb* \v 5 \rb The lords|סַרְנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the Philistines|פְלִשְׁתִּ֗ים\rb* \rb went|וַיַּעֲל֨וּ\rb* \rb to her|אֵלֶ֜יהָ\rb* \rb and said,|וַיֹּ֨אמְרוּ\rb* \rb “Entice|פַּתִּ֣י\rb* \rb him|אוֹת֗וֹ\rb* \rb and find out|וּרְאִי֙\rb* \rb the source of|בַּמֶּה֙\rb* \rb his great|גָד֔וֹל\rb* \rb strength|כֹּח֣וֹ\rb* \rb and how|וּבַמֶּה֙\rb* \rb we can overpower|נ֣וּכַל\rb* \rb him|ל֔וֹ\rb* \rb to tie him up|וַאֲסַרְנֻ֖הוּ\rb* \rb and subdue him.|לְעַנֹּת֑וֹ\rb* \rb Then each one|אִ֕ישׁ\rb* \rb of us|וַאֲנַ֙חְנוּ֙\rb* \rb will give|נִתַּן־\rb* \rb you|לָ֔ךְ\rb* \rb eleven hundred shekels|אֶ֥לֶף\rb*\rb |וּמֵאָ֖ה\rb* \rb of silver.|כָּֽסֶף׃\rb*\f + \fr 16:5 \fqa 1,100 shekels \ft is approximately 27.6 pounds or 12.5 kilograms of silver.\f*”
\p \v 6 \rb So Delilah|דְּלִילָה֙\rb* \rb said|וַתֹּ֤אמֶר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Samson,|שִׁמְשׁ֔וֹן\rb* \rb “Please|נָּ֣א\rb* \rb tell|הַגִּֽידָה־\rb* \rb me|לִ֔י\rb* \rb the source|בַּמֶּ֖ה\rb* \rb of your great|גָד֑וֹל\rb* \rb strength|כֹּחֲךָ֣\rb* \rb and how|וּבַמֶּ֥ה\rb* \rb you can be tied up|תֵאָסֵ֖ר\rb* \rb and subdued.”|לְעַנּוֹתֶֽךָ׃\rb*
