\s1 Delilah Learns the Secret
\p \v 15 \rb “How|אֵ֚יךְ\rb* \rb can you say,|וַתֹּ֣אמֶר\rb*\rb |אֵלָ֗יו\rb* \rb ‘I love you,’”|אֲהַבְתִּ֔יךְ\rb* \rb she asked,|תֹּאמַ֣ר\rb* \rb “when your heart|וְלִבְּךָ֖\rb* \rb is not|אֵ֣ין\rb* \rb with me?|אִתִּ֑י\rb* \rb This|זֶ֣ה\rb* \rb is the third|שָׁלֹ֤שׁ\rb* \rb time|פְּעָמִים֙\rb* \rb you have mocked|הֵתַ֣לְתָּ\rb* \rb me|בִּ֔י\rb* \rb and failed|וְלֹא־\rb* \rb to reveal|הִגַּ֣דְתָּ\rb* \rb to me|לִּ֔י\rb* \rb the source|בַּמֶּ֖ה\rb* \rb of your great strength!”|כֹּחֲךָ֥\rb*\rb |גָדֽוֹל׃\rb*
